## 1. Files involved in creating/registering an owner (POST)

The POST flow is defined declaratively by an OfficeFloor pipeline:

- `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/resources/officefloor/rest/api/owners.POST.yml` — the pipeline. Ordered steps: `validate → email → unique → household → capacity → dailyLimit → build → customerCode → namesakes → save → respond`. The relevant nodes:
